msgstr "このような古いゲームでの標準の方法で、2Dと3Dの両方を描画します。"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7774
msgid ""
"Draws as Windows programs do, with OpenGL ready in case the game asks for "
"it. Leave it here unless the game won't start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7775
msgid ""
"The fastest, and what most games want. Leave it here unless the game won't "
"start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr "最も速く、ほとんどのゲームに合っています。ゲームが起動しないときや画面がおかしいとき以外は、このままにしてください。"

