"PC5はこの番号（%s%s）でゲームのカバー、背景、詳細を選びます。別のゲームのものになっている場合は、ゲームのSteamストアのリンク（store.steampowered.com/app/<番号>）にある番号を入力してください。空欄にすると、PC5がフォルダーをもう一度読み込みます。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:178
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved: used at the game's next start."
msgstr "保存しました。次にゲームを起動したときに使われます。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:191
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Files: change a game's text files"
msgstr "ファイル：ゲームのテキストファイルを変更"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:196
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Game folder"
msgstr "ゲームのフォルダー"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:196
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Windows (registry, saves, settings)"
msgstr "Windows（レジストリ、セーブデータ、設定）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:224
msgctxt "web"
msgid "This folder is empty"
msgstr "このフォルダーは空です"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:235
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Larger than 8 MB: too large to change here"
msgstr "8 MB超：大きすぎてここでは変更できません"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:239
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not shown: %s"
msgstr "表示できませんでした：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:253
msgctxt "web"
msgid "UTF-8 with its mark"
msgstr "UTF-8（BOM付き）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:254
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Western (one byte a letter)"
msgstr "西欧（1文字1バイト）"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:255
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"%s · %s line ends · %d lines · %s. Saved as it was: the same encoding and "
"line ends. A game reads it at its next start."
msgstr "%s ・改行 %s ・ %d行 ・ %s。元のまま保存されます（文字コードも改行も同じ）。ゲームは次の起動時に読み込みます。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:257
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "閉じる"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:265
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved."
msgstr "保存しました。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:273
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close without saving the changes?"
msgstr "変更を保存せずに閉じますか？"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:278
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Wine writes its .reg files while a game plays: change them only when no "
"game is running."
msgstr "Wineはゲーム中に.regファイルを書き込みます。変更はゲームが動いていないときだけにしてください。"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:280
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not opened: %s"
msgstr "開けませんでした：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:283
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Text files only (.ini, .cfg, .txt, .json, .reg and the like), up to 8 MB. "
"The console's File manager changes them too, a line at a time."
msgstr ""
"テキストファイル（.ini、.cfg、.txt、.json、.regなど）のみ、8 MBまで。本体のファイルマネージャーでも1行ずつ変更できます。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:294
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No games yet."
msgstr "まだゲームがありません。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:297
msgctxt "web"
msgid "USB drive"
msgstr "USBドライブ"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:298
msgctxt "web"
msgid "can't start"
msgstr "起動できません"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:303
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Settings: %s"
msgstr "設定：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:306
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Newest log"
msgstr "最新のログ"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:308
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "問題を報告"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:309
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Downloads the newest log and opens GitHub's form, filled in: attach the "
"log there."
msgstr "最新のログをダウンロードし、入力済みのGitHubのフォームを開きます。そこにログを添付してください。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:314
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report it works"
msgstr ""

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:315
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Opens GitHub's game compatibility form, filled in: say how well it runs "
"there, then post it."
msgstr ""

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:320
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Launch options (launch.txt)"
msgstr "起動オプション（launch.txt）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:321
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"The first line that isn't empty or a comment (# or ;) is added to the "
"program's command line."
msgstr "空行でもコメント（#や;）でもない最初の行が、プログラムのコマンドラインに追加されます。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:325
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Environment variables (env.txt)"
msgstr "環境変数（env.txt）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:325
msgctxt "web"
msgid "One NAME=value a line, set before the game starts."
msgstr "1行に1つずつ「NAME=value」の形で書きます。ゲームの起動前に設定されます。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:326
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Extra logging (winedebug.txt)"
msgstr "追加のログ（winedebug.txt）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:327
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Only when an issue asks for it, for example err+all,+seh. Empty it "
"afterwards: it slows the game down."
msgstr "Issueで求められたときだけ使います（例：err+all,+seh）。ゲームが遅くなるので、あとで空にしてください。"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:332
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The games didn't load: %s"
msgstr "ゲームを読み込めませんでした：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:345
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No logs kept."
msgstr "保存されているログはありません。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:349
msgctxt "web"
msgid "had a problem"
msgstr "問題あり"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:352
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The logs didn't load: %s"
msgstr "ログを読み込めませんでした：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:362 title/pc5_web_page.html:363
msgctxt "web"
msgid "the connection was lost"
msgstr "接続が切れました"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:389
#, c-format
